1
00:00:00,301 --> 00:00:01,591
Hello?

2
00:00:01,928 --> 00:00:04,428
(Sheldon:)Penny, this is not a good time.

3
00:00:04,597 --> 00:00:08,437
(Sheldon:)No, I told you, you're not prepared
for the Sanctum of Burning Souls.

4
00:00:09,852 --> 00:00:14,232
(Sheldon:)You need to be in a group of at least five
and one should be a level 35 healer.

5
00:00:14,399 --> 00:00:16,029
No, I can't log on and help you.

6
00:00:17,777 --> 00:00:19,987
(Sheldon:)We'll talk when I get home.

7
00:00:25,201 --> 00:00:27,791
(Sheldon:)I'm not getting the computing time,
am I?

8
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:29,957
(Leslie:)Dumb-ass.

9
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:36,630
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you have to do something
about Penny.

10
00:00:36,796 --> 00:00:39,836
(Sheldon:)She is interfering with my sleep.
She is interfering with my work.

11
00:00:40,007 --> 00:00:42,297
(Sheldon:)If I had another significant aspect
of my life...

12
00:00:42,468 --> 00:00:44,848
(Sheldon:)...I'm sure she'd be interfering
with that too.

13
00:00:46,305 --> 00:00:49,395
Why should I do something?
You introduced her to online gaming.

14
00:00:49,559 --> 00:00:53,399
(Sheldon:)Well, yes, but you're the one
who said hello to her when she moved in.

15
00:00:54,147 --> 00:00:57,487
(Sheldon:)If you'd simply restrained yourself,
none of this would be happening.

16
00:00:58,151 --> 00:01:02,321
- Well, just tell her to leave you alone.
- I did. I told her. I texted her.

